<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūgōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		1. ruga, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>wrinkled</i>, <i>shrivelled.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rugosiorem cum geras stola frontem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 93, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spadones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 9, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 1, 8, 112</span></i>
			.— <b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">senecta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					3, 5, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigore pagus (i. e. the villagers),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 18, 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanna,</span>”
				<i>that wrinkles his countenance</i>, <i>makes wry
						faces</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 91</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> (acc. to 1. ruga, I. B.), <i>wrinkled</i>, <i>creased</i>, <i>shrivelled</i>, <i>corrugated</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 44, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cortex populi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					5, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piper,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pruna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 13, 28, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
